    "title": "Last call for T C I bookings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By from Midland Acres ,\n1 days ago Bloomingburg, OH — This is the last chance to secure 2026 bookings to T C I, the richest 2-year-old colt trotter in history. Bookings to T C I 2,1:51.4; 3,1:50.4 ($1,831,072) are in high demand, and his book is subject to close by Dec. 31 without further notice. Breeders are encouraged to act now to ensure they retain a spot for this popular Ohio-based sire. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
